---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="高校风云 · 你的大学，你的时代" description="中国高校策略桌游。选择真人匹配或 AI 对战，在同一张牌桌上建设院系、争夺人才、参与国家工程。">
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="gxf-online">
    <header class="gxf-hero" id="lobby-hero">
      <div><p class="gxf-eyebrow">高校风云 / UNIVERSITY CHRONICLES</p><h1>你的大学，<br/><span>你的时代。</span></h1><p>一张牌桌，六十年校史。<br/>在时代的变局中，找到属于你的办学之道。</p><div class="hero-facts"><span>3–6 位校长</span><span>6 个时代</span><span>336 张卡牌档案</span></div></div>
      <div class="hero-editorial"><span class="hero-year">1990</span><div class="hero-divider"></div><span class="hero-year future">2050</span><p>从第一所院系<br/>到世界一流大学</p><span class="hero-edition">ONLINE EDITION / 01</span></div>
    </header>
    <section class="gxf-lobby" id="lobby" aria-labelledby="lobby-title">
      <div class="lobby-heading"><div><p class="gxf-eyebrow">TAKE YOUR SEAT</p><h2 id="lobby-title">选择你的对局</h2></div><p id="service-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">正在连接游戏服务…</p></div>
      <div class="mode-choices" role="group" aria-label="对局模式">
        <button type="button" id="mode-human" class="mode-card selected" aria-pressed="true"><span class="mode-number">01 / ONLINE</span><strong>真人匹配</strong><span>与其他校长同桌较量</span><small>等待 20 秒 · 真人优先 · 空位 AI 补齐</small><b class="mode-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</b></button>
        <button type="button" id="mode-ai" class="mode-card" aria-pressed="false"><span class="mode-number">02 / SOLO</span><strong>AI 对战</strong><span>按自己的节奏，经营一所大学</span><small>立即入桌 · 你亲自操作 · 自由思考</small><b class="mode-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</b></button>
      </div>
      <form id="match-form" class="gxf-form gxf-panel">
        <label>校长昵称<input id="nickname" name="nickname" maxlength="16" required autocomplete="nickname" placeholder="你的称呼" /></label>
        <label>执掌高校<select id="school" name="school" required><option value="">正在载入高校…</option></select></label>
        <label>牌桌人数<select id="table-size" name="size"><option value="3">3 人</option><option value="4" selected>4 人 · 推荐</option><option value="5">5 人</option><option value="6">6 人</option></select></label>
        <div class="gxf-buttons"><button id="match" type="submit" class="gxf-primary" disabled>开始真人匹配 →</button><button id="practice" type="button" class="gxf-primary" hidden disabled>开始 AI 对战 →</button><span id="mode-help">你的席位始终由你亲自操作。</span></div>
        <p id="school-preview" class="gxf-muted"></p>
      </form>
      <details class="gxf-rules"><summary>开始前，花一分钟了解线上规则</summary>
        <p>本次是基于实体 v0.5 的快速对战。每时代先免费申报，再按生源顺序轮流使用每人 4 AP。你的昵称旁始终标注“你 · 真人”，AI 对手会单独标注。入桌后点击“准备好了”才开始。</p>
        <p>AI 对战可自由思考；真人匹配每次操作 5 分钟，保持在线可继续思考。只有离线超时才由 AI 代走一次，重连后继续由你操作。AI 每步约 2.5 秒，进入新时代留出 5 秒发牌时间。</p>
        <p>已启用院系建设/升级、科研、工科转型、定价招募、招生、智库、双方确认调档、工程与评估。工程主导奖励统一为匹配院系 +1 强度，协同牵头 +1🔬，第二名 +1🏛。</p>
        <p>与实体规则的差异：人才采用定价招募；事件从 24 张已自动化事件中抽取；政策牌、人才拍卖/挖角、联盟合标、合并/拆分及大部分高校独有技能尚未启用。完整档案可查，全文不代表全部自动执行。</p>
        <a href="/assets/games/gaoxiao-fengyun/data/高校风云-游戏规则-v0.5.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">阅读实体 v0.5 规则全文 ↗</a>
      </details>
    </section>
    <section id="queue" class="gxf-panel gxf-queue" hidden aria-label="匹配中"><span class="gxf-pulse" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="gxf-eyebrow">FINDING YOUR TABLE</p><h2>正在寻找同桌校长</h2><p id="queue-summary" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p id="queue-names"></p><strong id="queue-timer"></strong><p>倒计时结束后，AI 将加入剩余席位。</p><button id="cancel-match">取消匹配</button></section>
    <p id="game-error" class="gxf-error" role="alert" hidden></p>
    <section id="room" hidden aria-labelledby="room-title">
      <header class="gxf-room-header"><div><p class="gxf-eyebrow" id="room-code"></p><h2 id="room-title">1990s · 初始申报</h2></div><div class="gxf-room-tools"><button id="motion-toggle" aria-pressed="false">动画：开</button><button id="resume" hidden>恢复操作</button><button id="leave-room">离开牌桌</button></div></header>
      <nav id="era-track" class="era-track" aria-label="时代进度"></nav>
      <section id="ready-panel" class="ready-panel" hidden><div><h2>先看清牌桌，再开始你的校史</h2><p id="ready-copy">你的席位由你亲自操作。准备完成后，才会开始发牌和行动。</p></div><button id="ready-button" class="gxf-primary">准备好了，开始对局</button></section>
      <section id="results" class="gxf-panel" hidden><p class="gxf-eyebrow">YOUR UNIVERSITY CHRONICLE</p><h2>校史终章</h2><div id="result-table"></div><button id="play-again" class="gxf-primary">再来一局</button></section>
      <div class="gxf-game-grid">
        <div class="table-column">
          <div class="table-caption"><span>同桌校长</span><span>点击校园，了解对手的学科布局</span></div>
          <div id="players" class="gxf-players"></div>
          <section class="felt-table" aria-label="公共牌桌">
            <header class="felt-heading"><div><p class="gxf-eyebrow">THE COMMON TABLE</p><h2>国家重大工程</h2></div><span>每人每时代最多 2 项</span></header>
            <div id="projects" class="gxf-projects"></div>
            <div class="event-strip"><div><p class="gxf-eyebrow">ERA EVENTS</p><h3>时代风向</h3></div><div id="events" class="gxf-events"></div></div>
            <div id="last-move" class="last-move" aria-live="polite"></div>
          </section>
          <section class="my-desk"><header><div><p class="gxf-eyebrow">YOUR CAMPUS</p><h2 id="my-school-title">我的校园</h2></div><span class="human-badge">你 · 真人操作</span></header><div id="my-resources" class="my-resources"></div><div id="campus" class="gxf-campus"></div></section>
          <section class="gxf-panel" id="transfers-panel" hidden><h2>跨校调档</h2><div id="transfers"></div></section>
        </div>
        <aside class="control-column">
          <section class="gxf-panel gxf-actions" id="action-panel"><div class="turn-heading"><p class="gxf-eyebrow">YOUR DECISION</p><strong id="turn-timer"></strong></div><h2>校务决策</h2><p id="turn-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div id="ap-dots" class="ap-dots" aria-label="行动点"></div><p id="action-hint"></p><label>行动类别<select id="action-type"></select></label><label>选择行动<select id="action-choice"></select></label><p id="action-description"></p><button id="execute" class="gxf-primary" disabled>确认执行</button><button id="pass" disabled>结束本时代的行动</button><p class="gxf-muted">市场和校园中的卡牌可点击选择；这里只显示资源足够的合法行动。</p></section>
          <section class="market-panel gxf-panel"><header><p class="gxf-eyebrow">SHARED MARKET</p><h2>共享市场</h2></header><div class="market-tabs" role="group" aria-label="市场类别"><button id="faculty-tab" aria-pressed="true">院系市场</button><button id="talent-tab" aria-pressed="false">人才市场</button></div><div id="faculty-market" class="gxf-market"></div><div id="talent-market" class="gxf-market" hidden></div></section>
          <details class="gxf-panel log-panel"><summary>校史记录</summary><ol id="game-log"></ol></details>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="gxf-archive gxf-panel" id="archive" aria-labelledby="archive-title"><div class="gxf-archive-header"><div><p class="gxf-eyebrow">THE COMPLETE COLLECTION</p><h2 id="archive-title">每一张牌，都有它的故事。</h2></div><p>高校 48 · 院系 96 · 人才 36<br/>事件 72 · 国家工程 60 · 政策 24</p></div><div class="gxf-archive-filters"><label>牌类<select id="archive-type"><option value="all">全部卡牌</option><option value="school">高校</option><option value="faculty">院系</option><option value="talent">人才</option><option value="event">事件</option><option value="project">国家工程</option><option value="policy">政策</option></select></label><label>搜索<input id="archive-search" type="search" placeholder="学校、门类、航天…"/></label></div><p id="archive-count" class="gxf-muted"></p><div id="archive-grid" class="gxf-archive-grid"></div><button id="more-cards">继续翻阅</button></section>
    <nav class="mobile-table-nav" aria-label="牌桌快捷导航"><button data-jump="players">看牌桌</button><button data-jump="my-resources">我的校园</button><button data-jump="action-panel">校务决策</button></nav>
    <dialog id="card-dialog"><button id="close-card" aria-label="关闭卡牌详情">关闭 ×</button><div id="card-detail"></div></dialog>
    <dialog id="leave-dialog"><h2>离开这张牌桌？</h2><p>退出后由 AI 接替你完成本局，可以重新匹配。如果只是暂时离开，保留页面即可；刷新也能重连。</p><div class="gxf-buttons"><button id="keep-playing">继续游戏</button><button id="confirm-leave">退出并交给 AI</button></div></dialog>
    <div id="era-transition" class="era-transition" hidden role="status" aria-live="polite"><div><p class="gxf-eyebrow">A NEW CHAPTER</p><strong id="transition-year"></strong><h2 id="transition-title">新的十年，新的机遇</h2><p>预算已到账 · 时代事件揭晓 · 国家工程立项</p><span>正在发牌，请稍候</span></div></div>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/games/gaoxiao-fengyun/online.css?v=1.1.0" />
  <script is:inline type="module" src="/assets/games/gaoxiao-fengyun/online.js?v=1.1.0"></script>
</BaseLayout>
